cff-version: 1.2.0
title: "Darwin Operator Symmetry Atlas (DOSA)"
message: "If you use this dataset or software, please cite it as below."
type: dataset
authors:
  - family-names: "Agourakis"
    given-names: "Demetrios Chiuratto"
    email: "demetrios@agourakis.med.br"
    affiliation: "Independent Researcher"
    orcid: "https://orcid.org/0009-0001-8671-8878"
repository-code: "https://github.com/agourakis82/darwin-atlas"
url: "https://github.com/agourakis82/darwin-atlas"
abstract: >-
  An operator-resolved, provenance-bound atlas of positional,
  reverse-complement compositional, periodic, and circular-representation
  symmetries in complete bacterial RefSeq replicons. Sounio is the canonical
  scientific producer and Julia is an independent artifact validator.
keywords:
  - bacterial genomics
  - dihedral symmetry
  - operator theory
  - epistemic computing
  - reproducible research
  - NCBI RefSeq
license: MIT
version: "0.1.0-alpha"
references:
